{"page":294,"verses":[{"verse_key":"18:5","surah":18,"ayah":5,"ar_uthmani":"مَّا لَهُم بِهِۦ مِنْ عِلْمٍ وَلَا لِـَٔابَآئِهِمْ ۚ كَبُرَتْ كَلِمَةً تَخْرُجُ مِنْ أَفْوَٰهِهِمْ ۚ إِن يَقُولُونَ إِلَّا كَذِبًا","en_translation_id":85,"en":"They have no knowledge about this, nor did their forefathers––it is a monstrous assertion that comes out of their mouths: what they say is nothing but lies.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"مَّا","en_gloss":"Not","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"18:5"},{"pos":2,"ar":"لَهُم","en_gloss":"they have","transliteration":"lahum","verse_key":"18:5"},{"pos":3,"ar":"بِهِۦ","en_gloss":"about it","transliteration":"bihi","verse_key":"18:5"},{"pos":4,"ar":"مِنْ","en_gloss":"any","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"18:5"},{"pos":5,"ar":"عِلْمٍۢ","en_gloss":"knowledge","transliteration":"ʿil'min","verse_key":"18:5"},{"pos":6,"ar":"وَلَا","en_gloss":"and not","transliteration":"walā","verse_key":"18:5"},{"pos":7,"ar":"لِـَٔابَآئِهِمْ ۚ","en_gloss":"their forefathers","transliteration":"liābāihim","verse_key":"18:5"},{"pos":8,"ar":"كَبُرَتْ","en_gloss":"Grave (is)","transliteration":"kaburat","verse_key":"18:5"},{"pos":9,"ar":"كَلِمَةًۭ","en_gloss":"the word","transliteration":"kalimatan","verse_key":"18:5"},{"pos":10,"ar":"تَخْرُجُ","en_gloss":"(that) comes out","transliteration":"takhruju","verse_key":"18:5"},{"pos":11,"ar":"مِنْ","en_gloss":"of","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"18:5"},{"pos":12,"ar":"أَفْوَٰهِهِمْ ۚ","en_gloss":"their mouths","transliteration":"afwāhihim","verse_key":"18:5"},{"pos":13,"ar":"إِن","en_gloss":"Not","transliteration":"in","verse_key":"18:5"},{"pos":14,"ar":"يَقُولُونَ","en_gloss":"they say","transliteration":"yaqūlūna","verse_key":"18:5"},{"pos":15,"ar":"إِلَّا","en_gloss":"except","transliteration":"illā","verse_key":"18:5"},{"pos":16,"ar":"كَذِبًۭا","en_gloss":"a lie","transliteration":"kadhiban","verse_key":"18:5"},{"pos":17,"ar":"٥","en_gloss":"(5)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"18:5"}]},{"verse_key":"18:6","surah":18,"ayah":6,"ar_uthmani":"فَلَعَلَّكَ بَـٰخِعٌ نَّفْسَكَ عَلَىٰٓ ءَاثَـٰرِهِمْ إِن لَّمْ يُؤْمِنُوا۟ بِهَـٰذَا ٱلْحَدِيثِ أَسَفًا","en_translation_id":85,"en":"But [Prophet] are you going to worry yourself to death over them if they do not believe in this message?","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"فَلَعَلَّكَ","en_gloss":"Then perhaps you would (be)","transliteration":"falaʿallaka","verse_key":"18:6"},{"pos":2,"ar":"بَـٰخِعٌۭ","en_gloss":"the one who kills","transliteration":"bākhiʿun","verse_key":"18:6"},{"pos":3,"ar":"نَّفْسَكَ","en_gloss":"yourself","transliteration":"nafsaka","verse_key":"18:6"},{"pos":4,"ar":"عَلَىٰٓ","en_gloss":"over","transliteration":"ʿalā","verse_key":"18:6"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ءَاثَـٰرِهِمْ","en_gloss":"their footsteps","transliteration":"āthārihim","verse_key":"18:6"},{"pos":6,"ar":"إِن","en_gloss":"if","transliteration":"in","verse_key":"18:6"},{"pos":7,"ar":"لَّمْ","en_gloss":"not","transliteration":"lam","verse_key":"18:6"},{"pos":8,"ar":"يُؤْمِنُوا۟","en_gloss":"they believe","transliteration":"yu'minū","verse_key":"18:6"},{"pos":9,"ar":"بِهَـٰذَا","en_gloss":"in this","transliteration":"bihādhā","verse_key":"18:6"},{"pos":10,"ar":"ٱلْحَدِيثِ","en_gloss":"[the] narration","transliteration":"l-ḥadīthi","verse_key":"18:6"},{"pos":11,"ar":"أَسَفًا","en_gloss":"(in) grief","transliteration":"asafan","verse_key":"18:6"},{"pos":12,"ar":"٦","en_gloss":"(6)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"18:6"}]},{"verse_key":"18:7","surah":18,"ayah":7,"ar_uthmani":"إِنَّا جَعَلْنَا مَا عَلَى ٱلْأَرْضِ زِينَةً لَّهَا لِنَبْلُوَهُمْ أَيُّهُمْ أَحْسَنُ عَمَلًا","en_translation_id":85,"en":"We have adorned the earth with attractive things so that We may test people to find out which of them do best,","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"إِنَّا","en_gloss":"Indeed, We","transliteration":"innā","verse_key":"18:7"},{"pos":2,"ar":"جَعَلْنَا","en_gloss":"We have made","transliteration":"jaʿalnā","verse_key":"18:7"},{"pos":3,"ar":"مَا","en_gloss":"what","transliteration":"mā","vers